{"id":"7d83e22f672cfb25","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-kolmogorov-complexity.md","title":"Kolmogorov Complexity","display":"df-kolmogorov-complexity — Kolmogorov Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity","aliases":["90-df-kolmogorov-complexity"],"display":"df-kolmogorov-complexity — Kolmogorov Complexity","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[90-df-effective-procedure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-kolmogorov-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kolmogorov-complexity — Kolmogorov Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B^*=\\mathcal B^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal B^*=\\mathcal B^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q,r,s\\in\\mathcal B^*\">\\(p,q,r,s\\in\\mathcal B^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 是空词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|p|\">\\(|p|\\)</span> 是长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pq\">\\(pq\\)</span> 是集合论有限词拼接。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*\">\\(U,V:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Effective}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a>，输入输出词均以恒等表示呈示，机器取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U\">\\(K_U\\)</span> 时固定满足下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>；这是显式前提，不从符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 推断最优性。此字串函数与计算历史章节的数值输出函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 由类型区分。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KGraph}\">\\(\\mathrm{KGraph}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\np\\preceq q&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists r\\in\\mathcal B^*\\ q=pr,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}(V)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nV:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*\\land\\mathrm{Effective}(V)\n\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\ (p\\preceq q\\Longrightarrow p=q),\\\\\n\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{PrefixMachine}(U)\\land\n\\forall V:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*\\ \\Bigl[\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}(V)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\ \\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\\n(U(q)=V(p)\\land|q|\\le|p|+c)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{KGraph}_U(s,n)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns\\in\\mathcal B^*\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\ (U(p)=s\\land|p|=n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\ (U(q)=s\\Longrightarrow n\\le|q|),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\mathcal B^*\\ \\exists!n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{KGraph}_U(s,n),\\\\\nK_U&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(s,n)\\in\\mathcal B^*\\times\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{KGraph}_U(s,n)\\},\\\\\nK_U&amp;:\\mathcal B^*\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\nK_U(s)&amp;=\\min\\{|p|:p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\land U(p)=s\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\np\\preceq q&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists r\\in\\mathcal B^*\\ q=pr,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}(V)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nV:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*\\land\\mathrm{Effective}(V)\n\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\ (p\\preceq q\\Longrightarrow p=q),\\\\\n\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{PrefixMachine}(U)\\land\n\\forall V:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*\\ \\Bigl[\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}(V)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\ \\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\\n(U(q)=V(p)\\land|q|\\le|p|+c)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{KGraph}_U(s,n)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns\\in\\mathcal B^*\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\ (U(p)=s\\land|p|=n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\ (U(q)=s\\Longrightarrow n\\le|q|),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\mathcal B^*\\ \\exists!n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{KGraph}_U(s,n),\\\\\nK_U&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(s,n)\\in\\mathcal B^*\\times\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{KGraph}_U(s,n)\\},\\\\\nK_U&amp;:\\mathcal B^*\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\nK_U(s)&amp;=\\min\\{|p|:p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\land U(p)=s\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}\">\\(\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}\\)</span> 在断言中正式定义，而不是用“最优通用机”作为未解释条件。保留原来的前缀复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U\">\\(K_U\\)</span>，不替换成普通复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_U\">\\(C_U\\)</span>。最小值是元理论中的自然数最小值，并没有向对象算术语言添入函数符号。</p>\n<p>对每个固定输出词，仅在空词上输出它的机器是前缀机器；最优性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的某个描述。故图的输出候选集非空，自然数良序性给出 Assertion 所列唯一值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effective-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U,V:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*$；$\\mathrm{Effective}$ 取 [[90-df-effective-procedure]]，输入输出词均以恒等表示呈示，机器取 [[88-df-turing-machine]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U,V:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*$；$\\mathrm{Effective}$ 取 [[90-df-effective-procedure]]，输入输出词均以恒等表示呈示，机器取 [[88-df-turing-machine]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B^*=\\mathcal B^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"p,q,r,s\\in\\mathcal B^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"|p|","display":false},{"tex":"pq","display":false},{"tex":"U,V:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Effective}","display":false},{"tex":"K_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\np\\preceq q&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists r\\in\\mathcal B^*\\ q=pr,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}(V)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nV:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*\\land\\mathrm{Effective}(V)\n\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\ (p\\preceq q\\Longrightarrow p=q),\\\\\n\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{PrefixMachine}(U)\\land\n\\forall V:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*\\ \\Bigl[\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}(V)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&\\quad\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\ \\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\\n(U(q)=V(p)\\land|q|\\le|p|+c)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{KGraph}_U(s,n)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns\\in\\mathcal B^*\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\ (U(p)=s\\land|p|=n)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\ (U(q)=s\\Longrightarrow n\\le|q|),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\mathcal B^*\\ \\exists!n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{KGraph}_U(s,n),\\\\\nK_U&\\coloneqq\\{(s,n)\\in\\mathcal B^*\\times\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{KGraph}_U(s,n)\\},\\\\\nK_U&:\\mathcal B^*\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\nK_U(s)&=\\min\\{|p|:p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\land U(p)=s\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrefixMachine}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}","display":false},{"tex":"K_U","display":false},{"tex":"C_U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":2891,"backlinks":[{"id":"5cc312c6e3fc50d2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)$、$K_U$ 见 [[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]]；无界性见 [[90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded]]。"},{"id":"8959cc2a17246321","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)$、$K_U$ 见 [[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]]；无界性见 [[90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded]]。"},{"id":"1f8fee89a8d4aa2f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)$ 是 [[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]] 断言中的谓词；该文件同时保证 $K_U$ 对所有有限字串有定义。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md